<title>USA: Wall Street up at opening.</title>
<headline>Wall Street up at opening.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow industrials and the Nasdaq composite index opened up Monday, helped by encouraging earnings reports.</p>
<p>--Dow Industrials up 1.21 at 6392.90</p>
<p>--Nasdaq Composite up 2.51 at 1209.41.</p>
<p>--S&amp;P Index up 0.28 at 737.93.</p>
<p>--NYSE advance/decline 406/612</p>
<p>--Nasdaq advance/decline 800/7717</p>
<p>--The 30-year long bond unchanged to yield 7.17 pct.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1737</p>
</text>
